2) Students are expected to develop the following skills and appreciate values that:
- cultivate the capabilities for critical analysis of the diversity of values and interests in society;
- develop the creative ability in drawing on a number of disciplinary origins within areas of the arts, popular culture, humanities and social sciences to appreciate the richness and the usefulness of cultures in all forms;
